# Production files

This directory should contain **production version files only**:

### Docker production files
- Caddyfile.prod
- Dockerfile
- docker-compose.yml

### User configuration example
- nightscout-lucid.env

### Helper scripts
- up.sh
- down.sh
- build.sh (for building a new docker image)
- push.sh (for pushing the docker image to the docker registry repository)

# Note:
- Before building and deploying, make sure to update the *Docker production files*
- For building the docker image, make sure this directory is part of the complete nighscout-lucid GitHub repository
- For external host deployment, copy the content of this directory to the host (docker image will be downloaded from the docker registry)
